{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RbqMGtUhyl1793053593.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場憧憬美國聯邦儲備局本周議息將維持利率不變，加上油價回軟紓緩通脹壓力，金價重上4,000美元以上水平。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,038.4美元一盎司，升30.5美元，升幅百分之0.7。現貨金價一度升至4,029.84美元，升33.74美元，升幅百分之0.8，最新在4,010美元附近徘徊。</p><p></p><p>StoneX高級市場策略員哈伯肯認為，油價回落吸引部分投資者趁低吸納，但聯儲局發表議息聲明前，相信金市交投淡靜，金價會在4,000美元附近水平徘徊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.675505+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:10.068459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T22:58:15.201761+00:00","content_hash":"492294b23e32fe5eef943104008941e61046dee86373a5c15d768387a3a3d909","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.675505+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}